  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "The vector $a$ has magnitude $3$, the vector $b$ has magnitude $15,$ the angle between $a$ and $b$ is ${40}^{\u2218}$ and $n$ is the unit vector that points in the direction of $a\\times b.$ Find $a\\times b$ in terms of $n.$ Round your final answer to one decimal place where appropriate.",
